{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<img alt=\"長沙灣十歲女童被打及獨留在家　母涉虐兒被捕\" src=\"https://news.now.com/nownews/NewsImage/2026-11-08-23-37-21NLxOPw8T.jpg\"><p>【Now新聞台】長沙灣麗翠苑一名十歲女童疑遭虐打及被獨留在家，警方拘捕其43歲母親。</p><p>警方周日早上接獲一名69歲男子報案，指在麗翠苑麗柏閣一個單位，發現10歲孫女被獨留在家，並懷疑曾被打左臉及腹部等，女童送院檢查，其43歲母親涉虐兒被捕。</p><p></p></body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-09T10:21:57.781733+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":119,"images":1,"source":"Now 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-08T14:06:30+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-09T10:35:52.329237+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-09T10:15:55.609543+00:00","content_hash":"5a03735fe5b35ed696102bd51170e4eae1dfd72e7f7bff8baaa7c61fc302e9a1","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-09T10:21:57.781733+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}